 16.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a vibrant Business Networking Event in Toronto whe
 re you may meet your next client or referral partner. Discover opportuniti
 es and connect! Register now.\nREGISTER HERE: https://gtapreneurs.com/netw
 orking-events-toronto\nVENUE: The Village Hive Eglinton\nADDRESS: 120 Egli
 nton Ave E\, Suite 202\, Toronto\, ON ​\nTRANSIT: Get off at Eglinton su
 bway station\, walk East down Eglinton a few minutes and you will find it 
 on the north side of the street in a tall office building\nPARKING: Garage
  under the building\nITINERARY:\n* 6:00-7:00pm: Open networking\n* 7:00-7:
 05pm: GTApreneurs’ presentation\n* 7:05-7:15pm: Venue Host presentation:
