 00pm: Open networking\n*Appetizers and beverages provided.\nTICKETS:\nGTAp
 reneurs’ Members: Free\nNon-members: $20\n*Includes a Guest Contact Shee
 t emailed to you the day after the event. Note: You need to attend the eve
 nt to receive the sheet.\nHOSTS:\nTammy Defoe\, President of GTApreneurs\n
 Learn more about Tammy’s Coaching services at www.gtapreneurs.com/busine
 ss-coaching-toronto\nQUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT? Call 416-522-7770 or email
  info@gtapreneurs.com\nand\nSerene Chin\, Community Manager at The Village
  Hive Eglinton.\nSerene is the friendly and dedicated Community Manager at
