  Fluent in four languages and a volunteer with the Markham Dog Alliance\, 
 she brings warmth\, enthusiasm\, and a true connector’s spirit to The Hi
 ve.\nCONTACT SERENE:\n(647) 500-0980 | www.thevillagehive.ca/eglinton | in
