 37.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Stroll through Little Italy and experience a taste of la bella
  vita as you discover how Italian immigrants transformed College Street in
 to a vibrant hub of food\, business\, cultural traditions\, and belonging.
 \nHighlighting various key historical sites\, businesses\, and institution
 s that have shaped the Italian-Canadian experience from the early 20th cen
 tury to the current day\, this walk integrates historical research and sto
 rytelling to create an immersive understanding of the community’s impact
  on the city’s social and cultural fabric.
