 58.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday\, check out Ambassador Pizza Co. for Pop Cultu
 re Trivia Nights that pop with personality!\nWHAT TO EXPECT Legendary pizz
 a. Legendary trivia. Wednesday nights at Ambassador just became your new r
 eligion.\nQE Trivia brings its signature high-energy format to one of Toro
 nto's most beloved spots on Bloor West — expect big laughs\, big questio
 ns\, and an even bigger slice.\nTHE GAME\n10 pop culture categories — mu
 sic\, TV\, celebrity\, film\, memes\, and more\nInteractive challenges tha
 t have nothing to do with knowing facts and everything to do with being un
 hinged in the best way\nThe Ambassador Cheese Pull Challenge — go long f
 or bonus points 🧀\nFinal wager round — flip the table (metaphorically
 )\nWHO SHOULD ATTEND You're already here for the pizza. Stay for the trivi
 a. Leave a legend.\nThis is game night for people who think trivia is bori
 ng (it's not\, not here) and people who are already regulars at APC who wa
 nt to turn their Wednesday night into a full experience.\n🏆 PRIZES Rota
 ting weekly prizes including:\nGRETA 1 Hour Unlimited Play Cards\nAPC Merc
 h & pizzas!\nRotating weekly sponsor prizes\n🌊 ELECTRIC ISLAND SUMMER T
 ICKET GIVEAWAY 🌊 Every Eventbrite RSVP enters you into our Electric Isl
 and ticket raffle. More shows = more entries. Details from the host.\nVENU
 E & TICKET INFO Game starts at 7 PM — arrive by 6:45 PM to get settled.\
 nWaitlist available if sold out\n$25 minimum spend per person
