BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SAME TIME  \, SAME PLACE  Furniture Design
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260603T170000
UID:blogto-235822@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/31/original_image38f09af7-6f87-4b5d-8143-b0f0dad9a7
 42.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Gallery 1313\nJune 3-7th\n1313 Queen St. West\nMedia 647-769-1
 568\n“Same Time\, Same Place” brings together the work of eleven recen
 t graduates from the Sheridan College Honours Bachelors Craft and Design (
 Furniture) program. The exhibition showcases a wide range of approaches to
  furniture design\, from traditional woodworking and contemporary furnitur
 e to works beyond conventional materials\, processes\, and typologies. Dev
 eloped through months of research\, experimentation\, and dedication\, eac
 h piece reflects an individual practice shaped within a collective environ
 ment. This show captures the moment where eleven distinct voices meet in t
 he same time\, and same place.\nWorks by Logan Clarke\, Sarah Gomes\, Zeen
 a Ismail\, Garrett Joyce\, Anamika Kanthan\, Saadet Kural\, Seren Kwansnie
 wski-Burke\, Galen Lau\, Ian MacGregor\, Julie Nguyen\, and Chloe Nicole P
 angan
LOCATION:Gallery 1313
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/same-time-same-place-furniture-design-to
 ronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
