 80.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of board g
 ames\, this event offers something for everyone. Discover new games\, chal
 lenge your friends\, and make new connections with fellow board game lover
 s along the way. Come as a group or solo and we can help pair you with a c
 ommunity table. Our events are a great way to connect with members of loca
 l communities and are perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to mee
 t new people.\nFor games\, we have plenty to choose from including Coup\, 
 Codenames\, Splendor\, Catan\, Love Letter\, and many more! You are welcom
 e to bring games from your own collection if you wish. And all board game 
 experience levels are welcome.\nThanks to the generosity of Twilight Cafe 
 Midtown\, we will have plenty of space for the night to play board games! 
 Tickets for this event are $10.00 or free for Changeling Members\, and inc
 lude access to the gameplay area\, a curated collection of board games\, a
 nd on-site game experts who can help you with player introductions\, game 
 selection\, and running how-to-plays for your table.\nWherever you are on 
 the sapphic spectrum\, you are invited to join us!\nTo learn more\, find C
 hangeling Gaming Events Toronto on Eventbrite or click the website link to
  see this event (see right side on desktop/above on mobile).
LOCATION:Twilight Cafe Midtown
