 gto.com/events/2026/03/26/original_image8e1070dc-9f3e-47d8-9132-201d40f3f7
 80.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Scitechseries is excited to announce the "3rd International Co
 nference on Ophthalmology & Vision Science" (ICOVS 2026)\, scheduled as a 
 Hybrid Event in Paris\, France\, from June 04–05\, 2026.\nThis HYBRID EV
 ENT allows you to participate in person at Paris\, France or virtually fro
 m your home or workplace.\nConference theme: "Visionary Breakthroughs: Sha
 ping the Future of Eye Health" focuses on cutting-edge research and advanc
 ements in the field.\nICOVS 2026 aims to provide a premier platform where 
 you can explore the latest research\, engage in networking\, and contribut
 e to the success of the conference. A diverse audience—including ophthal
 mologists\, doctors\, healthcare professionals\, nurses\, clinicians\, aca
 demicians\, medical experts\, students\, researchers\, professors\, and sc
 ientists from leading medical institutions—will come together to share g
 roundbreaking research findings\, innovative ideas\, and experiences.\nYou
 r participation will contribute significantly to shaping the future direct
 ion of Ophthalmology and Vision Science.
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/3rd-international-conference-on-ophthalm
 ology-vision-science-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
