 gto.com/events/2026/04/11/original_image855922d4-a15f-49b5-97d9-9e93a286ec
 7d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Toronto\, if you’re looking for a night out that actually fe
 els good\, Laugh It Forward is the event for you!\nOn June 4\, 2026\, at 7
 :00 PM\, the Society Clubhouse is opening its doors for an evening of stan
 d-up comedy dedicated to supporting the Vitality Project\, a collective ac
 tion initiative that provides emergency food baskets and clean drinking wa
 ter to families in Gaza.\nThis isn’t just another open mic or showcase. 
 This is a curated night where the punchlines come with a purpose. So come 
 pack the room\, laugh until your sides hurt\, and contribute to a cause th
 at’s making a tangible difference!\nWhether you’re a comedy nerd hunti
 ng for the next big headliner or just someone who wants to get out of the 
 house and support a great cause\, this one is worth adding to your calenda
 r.\nSee you there. 🥂🎤
LOCATION:The Society Clubhouse
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/laugh-it-forward-toronto-4/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
