 asino’s success\, and tonight is your reward… until the celebration ta
 kes a deadly turn. One guest won’t make it through the evening\, and sud
 denly everyone is a suspect.\nEnjoy canapés and calamity as you immerse y
 ourself in the mystery. Mingle with suspicious characters\, follow the clu
 es\, question motives\, and see if you can crack the case before the night
  is over.\nYour ticket includes:\nA fully interactive murder mystery exper
 ience\nDelicious canapés\nGaming tables*\nA chance to win prizes\nOne com
 plimentary beer or wine\nBeer and wine will be available for purchase.\nCo
 me ready to play\, connect\, and be in the moment. Whether you’re solvin
