BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Question Everything Trivia @ Fortunate Fox l Thursday nights just 
 got a Friday glow up
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260604T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260604T210000
UID:blogto-235829@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/01/original_image1327ee1d-e9e4-4bf1-86b3-a89a94ae48
 19.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Every Thursday\, check out The Fortunate Fox for a posh and pr
 oper Trivia Night!\nWHAT TO EXPECT Thursday nights just got a whole lot lo
 uder. QE Trivia takes over the Fox with 2+ hours of pop culture mayhem\, h
 osted by the QE team — high energy\, high BPM\, zero boring questions.\n
 THE GAME\n10 categories spanning music\, TV\, film\, celebrity culture\, a
 nd whatever's breaking the internet this week\nSurprise interactive rounds
  that reward quick thinking and chaotic energy\nA final wager round that c
 hanges everything\nWHO SHOULD ATTEND The Fox already has great vibes — w
 e just turn them up to eleven.\nQE Trivia is for the crew that loves a goo
 d time more than memorizing encyclopedias. Pop culture knowledge? Nice to 
 have. Good company and a competitive streak? Essential.\n🏆 PRIZES Weekl
 y prizes always include:\n$50 Fortunate Fox Gift Card\nGRETA 1 Hour Unlimi
 ted Play Cards\nRotating sponsor prizes announced by the host\n🌊 ELECTR
 IC ISLAND SUMMER TICKET GIVEAWAY 🌊 RSVP through Eventbrite = automatic 
 entry into our Electric Island ticket raffle. Show up every week\, rack up
