BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Arcadia by Tom Stoppard
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T223000
UID:blogto-234865@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/11/original_image072dfbc3-3a2b-41b3-ade3-1c57c56434
 74.jpg
DESCRIPTION:About the Show\nWhat do mathematics\, desire\, chaos theory\, 
 and Lord Byron have in common? Tom Stoppard’s dazzling masterpiece Arcad
 ia.\nMoving between 1809 and the present day\, Arcadia unfolds at the gran
 d Coverley estate\, where brilliant young Thomasina and her tutor Septimus
  explore love\, science\, and the mysteries of the universe against the ba
 ckdrop of a changing English landscape.\nTwo centuries later\, modern scho
 lars dig through letters\, rumours\, and rival theories to uncover what re
 ally happened at the estate — including a scandal that may have involved
  the infamous Lord Byron himself.\nFunny\, romantic\, and intellectually t
 hrilling\, Arcadia is widely considered one of the greatest plays of the m
 odern era. Whether you love period drama\, razor-sharp wit\, literary myst
 ery\, or stories that make you think and feel deeply\, this production off
 ers an unforgettable night of theatre.\nRating and Content Warnings\nRecom
 mended for age 14 and up.\nShow Times\nJune 5\, 6\, 11\, 12\, 13\, 18 and 
 19\, 2026 at 8pm\nJune 7\, 14 and 20\, 2026 at 2pm\nSpecial Events - Pleas
 e Join Us\nFriday\, June 5\, 2026 -  Opening Night Performance followed by
  a Reception\nTicket Prices\nRegular Tickets - $28\nUnder 30 / 60 and Over
  - $24\nGroup Rate Ticket - $22
LOCATION:Scarborough Village Theatre
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/arcadia-by-tom-stoppard-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
