 45.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s first-ever Canadian preview of Quince arrives June
  5-6.\nQuince\, the modern lifestyle brand known for high-quality essentia
 ls at radically fair prices\, is bringing its first Canadian pop-up experi
 ence to Toronto with The Art of Linen\, an immersive celebration of the fa
 bric of the season.\nRunning June 5 and 6\, the two-day experience invites
  guests to explore a curated capsule of Quince’s 100% European linen col
 lection across Women’s\, Men’s\, Kids\, Home and accessories\, alongsi
 de highlights from the brand’s broader assortment. At the centre of the 
 space is a larger-than-life linen installation by Toronto artist Charlotte
  Blake\, designed to bring the texture\, movement and artistry of linen to
  life.\nThe Art of Linen is built around one idea: fabric you actually wan
 t to touch.\nGuests who sign up at the pop-up will receive an exclusive of
 fer to shop quince.ca. The first 250 guests each day will also receive a c
 omplimentary iced matcha from Pilot Coffee Roasters and a surprise gift fr
 om Quince.\nPlus\, the first 25 people in line each day who follow @onequi
 nce on Instagram will receive a complimentary Quince 100% European Linen 
