SUMMARY:TAKES A VILLAGE: Potluck Sessions Vol. 1 Album Release Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260605T220000
UID:blogto-235160@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/18/original_imagec17f4c50-2c6c-4703-9e81-43a821e8b9
 1b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the debut album\, "Potluck Sessions Vol. 1" from Tor
 onto collective\, TAKES A VILLAGE. Featuring 16 different artists\, listen
  to the album with a live band from front to back at The Drake Underground
  on Friday\, Saturday\, June 5th!\n"Potluck Sessions Vol. 1" Vinyl Record 
 and T-Shirts will also be available - we have packaged tickets as well.\nC
 heck out the Vinyl here: https://hmltlive.myshopify.com/products/takes-a-v
 illage-potluck-sessions-vol-1-album-vinyl\nFor the early supporters\, you 
 can download/stream the project before the official drop at: https://takes
 avillagemusic.bandcamp.com/album/potluck-sessions-vol-1\nIG: www.instagram
 .com/takesavillagemusic\nWebsite: www.takesavillagemusic.com\nTakes a Vill
 age Music is a Toronto-based collective of rotating artists\, producers\, 
 and musicians\, led by music producer and creative director Corey “HMLT
 ” Wong. At its core is "Potluck" — a weekly session where artists come
  together to collaborate\, share ideas\, and add their own artistic flair 
 to the music.\nShaped by Toronto’s cultural diversity\, the sound pulls 
 from a wide range of global influences while staying grounded in the city
 ’s unique creative identity. Potluck has also expanded beyond the studio
 \, sparking collaborations with the local food scene and blending music wi
 th culinary experiences.
LOCATION:Drake Underground
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/takes-a-village-potluck-sessions-vol-1-a
 lbum-release-party-toronto/
