 plore our 2-level gallery as you settle in and enjoy a thoughtfully curate
 d playlist designed to set the tone. Guided by an experienced instructor\,
  you’ll learn how to work with textured paste\, paint\, and a variety of
  tools to create rich textures and mesmerizing patterns on canvas. In the 
 second half of the workshop\, you’ll bring your piece to life with colou
 r\, transforming it into a statement artwork ready to hang.\nWhat’s Incl
 uded:\n• Guided instruction and creative support throughout the session\
 n• Canvas\, compound paste\, paint\, and all necessary tools\n• Relaxi
 ng studio atmosphere with music\n• Complimentary coffee\, refreshments\,
  and snacks\nWho Can Attend:\nPerfect for beginners and experienced artist
 s alike. Come solo or with a friend and connect with like-minded creatives
  in a supportive\, inspiring environment.\nAges 10+ welcome. Guests younge
 r than 16 must attend with a paying 18+ adult.\nWhether you’re looking t
 o add dimension to your walls or simply explore a new creative outlet\, th
 is Textured Art Workshop offers an enriching and inspiring experience at A
 rtbox.\nNo experience needed!\nSee more events at: https://www.artboxstudi
 ogallery.com/calendar\nCall us at: 647-617-9550
