  night out is packed with throwback hits\, awesome people\, and good vibes
  — come on time to get the most out of your night! Whether you’re here
  to reconnect\, hang with friends\, or dance your heart out\, expect a nig
 ht full of high energy\, nostalgia\, and feel-good fun from start to finis
 h!\nCome as you are -- or dress for the throwback if you want!\nA portion 
 of proceeds supports Breast Cancer Research.\nPlease Note: Adelaide Hall i
