 t\, inclusive celebration of queer culture\, bringing together drag perfor
 mers\, musicians\, and fans for a full day of entertainment\, education\, 
 and self-expression.\nCanada's Official 2SLGBTQ+ Drag\, Arts & Music Conve
 ntion\nGet ready for the PRIDE KICK-OFF EVENT of the summer - the ultimate
  celebration of drag\, music\, art\, and community at Fierce and Fabulous 
 Expo\, an official Major Cultural Partner of Pride Toronto!\nGrab your bes
 ties and get into Pride Month festivities with your favourite superstar qu
 eens! Saturday\, June 6\, 2026\, from 9 a.m. to 7 p.m. at Metro Toronto C
 onvention Centre\, Toronto 255 Front St W (North Building - Hall A)\nALL A
 GES\nJoin thousands of fans\, creators\, and changemakers for a spectacula
 r experience that celebrates bold self-expression and world-class talent. 
 Whether you're a die-hard drag fan\, music lover\, creative entrepreneur\,
  or proud community supporter — this is the place to be to kick off PRID
 E MONTH!\nGet your tickets today!
