 88.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This formerly industrial neighbourhood—site of the historica
 l Kodak film plant—is incredibly diverse and home to a variety of "hidde
 n gem" independent restaurants. As a brand new transit hub (terminal stati
 on of the Eglinton LRT + UP Express and Go Transit stop)\, Mount Dennis is
  now easier to access than ever. Come join @itsrainingmian on a food tour 
 of Mount Dennis and we'll explore some of the exciting eats this burgeonin
 g area has to offer. Tickets are $60 per person and include at least 5 foo
