ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/28/original_image1d5d7d9a-31de-496b-90db-d7dd01ab77
 97.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A Saturday full of incredible artists! Support queer & trans a
 rt! FREE entry - get something special for yourself or someone you love.\n
 One of many Pride Month artist markets at Glad Day Lit! Over 60 vendors be
 tween June 6th & 13th! RSVP for the Eventbrite for the 13th while you're h
 ere and claim your chance to win a $25 credit to the market!\nThis is FREE
  to attend but if you RSVP you get entered into a draw to get $25 to spend
  at the market! Name will be drawn the night before the event. One entry p
 er person.\nVendors:\n(For more vendor info check our instagram @gladdaybo
 okshop!)\nFAITHSKNITTEDFTNEGATIV0\nRobin K Herman\nThe Happy Yam\nSpice Ba
 bies\nEunice Lai\nHouse of Polari\nAnothertechnique\nElliot Woods\nAmanda 
 Makes\nFormer Wasteland\nMirror Path Collective\nBeadstore Cowboy\nCOVEN b
 y Sonia Kang\nObscure Creations\nRonanko\nCandi Craft\nCherub Crater\nAtla
 s Do Vale\nhellafroot\nBad Gutz\ncslackdesign\nKat Bell\nvinemind\nTyler\n
 The Cutie Artist\nFruity Frog Creations\nCat Love\nThe entrance\, washroom
  and space are wheelchair accessible.\nMOBILITY DEVICE ACCESSIBILITY : IMP
 ORTANT ALTERNATIVE because of snow(this is a note for people in wheelchair
 s\, scooter\, with a walker or folks who cannot do more than 2 stairs)\nWh
 ile our front door and the inside of the space is accessible\, some enviro
 nmental factors (like snow) can impact the path to the front door through 
 the park. So here is the accessible alternative:\nYou can access our front
  door by going through the condo next door.\nOPTION #1: 21 Abell St - Get 
 dropped off or picked up at 21 Abell and enter the condo from the east sid
 e. Go through the lobby and then out the north (main) door\, you are then 
 at Glad Day.\nOPTION #2: Get dropped off at the parking garage behind 47 A
 bell / 16 Lisgar. Enter the condo from the south side\, which is a covered
  driveway behind the condo. You enter from the south\, you walk through th
 e lobby and then out the north (main) door\, you are then at Glad Day. Thi
 s one can be tricky so the 21 Abell option is often more reliable.
LOCATION:Glad Day Lit
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/glad-day-lits-pride-month-artist-market-
 june-6-toronto/
