BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Roaring 1920s Jazz Age Saturday Night Swing Dance with Ben Harvey 
 and his Ornamentals and Beginner Dance Lessons Before
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T230000
UID:blogto-235594@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/27/original_imaged90cb665-68ea-450e-b62e-c5da3bbf96
 c0.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, June 6 for a lively 1920s Jazz Age Garde
 n Dance Party featuring live music by Ben Harvey and His Ornamentals — p
 lus two beginner-friendly 1920s dance lessons beforehand!\nNo partner requ
 ired. Dance any role. Everyone welcome.\n1920s attire is encouraged but no
 t required. Dress up if you’d like — there will be photo opportunities
  and props available!\nLocation:\nSt. Barnabas Church\n175 Hampton Ave\nSc
 hedule:\n5:30 PM – Doors Open\nBeginner Dance Lessons | 6:00 PM – 7:40
  PM\n6:00 PM – 6:30 PM\n1920s Partner & Solo Charleston Lesson\n6:30 PM 
 – 7:40 PM\n1920s Vernacular Foxtrot & One Step Lesson\nFrom fast and jaz
 zy to slow and flowy! These were among the most popular social dances of t
 he Jazz Age\, when partner dancing ruled the dance floor. Fun\, free-spiri
 ted\, and easy to learn — the basic step is simply walking.\n7:45 PM –
  11:00 PM\n1920s Jazz Age Garden Dance Party\nPricing:\nRoaring 20s Saturd
 ay Night Dance Ticket – $29\nIncludes dance party + 2 beginner lessons\n
 Saturday Full Package – $65\nIncludes workshops\, lessons\, and dance ad
 mission (2:00 PM – 11:00 PM)\nFull-time student pricing available\nWeeke
 nd Event Information:\nThis event is part of our 1920s Jazz Age Dance Week
 end\, featuring workshops\, lessons\, and three dances across the weekend.
  Join us for the full experience or simply come for one event — everyone
  is welcome!\nHosted by Swing Toronto & Waltz Toronto
LOCATION:St. Barnabas
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/roaring-1920s-jazz-age-saturday-night-sw
 ing-dance-with-ben-harvey-and-his-ornamentals-and-beginner-dance-lessons-b
 efore-toronto/
