BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Best of Theydies - Pride Comedy Showcase & Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260606T220000
UID:blogto-235750@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/29/original_image078534fc-d012-4ade-a7a1-bda8ab8157
 05.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This is the funniest collection of Women\, Queers\, & Allies y
 ou will find this Pride Kick Off Weekend!!!\nThe Best of They'dies - Pride
  Showcase -\nAbout This Event\nCheck out Canada's only comedy club the Com
 edy Lab queer comedy showcase! As a part of the Werd Entertainment Pride K
 ick Off weekend "The Best of They'dies - Pride Showcase" is a pioneering c
 omedy show that shines a spotlight on the vibrant and diverse talents with
 in the queer community in Toronto and well beyond.\nJoin us for a night of
  laughter\, empowerment\, and unforgettable performances as we celebrate t
 he voices and stories that often go unheard. This showcase isn't just abou
 t entertainment\; it's a powerful expression of identity\, resilience\, an
 d the joy that comes from embracing one’s true self.\nWhy You Should Att
 end\nQueer Voices Front and Center: Experience a lineup of incredibly tale
 nted queer comedians who bring their unique perspectives\, experiences\, a
 nd humour to the stage in a powerful display of artistry and self-expressi
 on.\nA Celebration of Diversity: "The Best of They'dies - Pride Showcase" 
 is a testament to the diversity within the LGBTQ+ community\, highlighting
  a range of experiences\, backgrounds\, and comedic styles in one upliftin
 g and hilarious show.\nConnect and Belong: This event is more than just a 
 comedy show\; it's a community gathering where individuals can connect\, s
 hare laughs\, and feel a sense of belonging in a supportive and inclusive 
 environment.\nBreak Stereotypes: Through humour\, our performers tackle st
 ereotypes\, share personal stories\, and challenge societal norms\, offeri
 ng insightful and thought-provoking perspectives that resonate with all au
 diences.\nThe Lineup\nPrepare to be entertained by a dynamic roster of que
 er comedians who are ready to take the stage by storm. These artists are t
 he heartbeat of the queer comedy scene\, bringing with them a wealth of ex
 periences and a knack for storytelling that will leave you laughing\, refl
 ecting\, and maybe even shedding a tear. Check out our Instagram for the o
 fficial lineup announcement!\nGet Your Tickets Now\nDon't miss out on this
  extraordinary night of comedy\, community\, and celebration. "The Best of
  They'dies - Pride Showcase" will be a memorable experience\, showcasing t
 he best in queer comedic talent. Whether you're part of the LGBTQ+ communi
 ty or an ally looking to support and enjoy phenomenal comedy\, this show i
 s for you.\nBe part of something special. Grab your tickets today!
LOCATION:The Comedy Lab
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-best-of-theydies-pride-comedy-showca
 se-party-toronto/
