  from 10 a.m. to 11 a.m. beside the Pavilion. Presented In collaboration w
 ith NÜLOVE\, classes are led by some of the GTA’s most experienced move
 ment instructors. Each session blends hatha and vinyasa yoga\, with a focu
 s on mindfulness\, core strength\, and building a deeper connection betwee
 n breath\, body\, and spirit. Throughout the season\, special monthly clas
 ses will feature unique experiences like Acro Yoga Fusions\, Yoga Dance Pa
 rties with Dance Alchemy\, Awaken with JUNGLETO (a yoga and fitness fusion
 )\, as well as Pilates\, live music\, and meditation—creating fresh ways
  to move\, breathe\, and connect with a growing community. Classes are ope
 n to all levels and are rain or shine. No registration is required! Just b
 ring your yoga mat\, water bottle\, and sunscreen/hat for sun protection.
