BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:F1inTO Monaco Grand Prix Watch Party. Toronto's Biggest F1 Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T120000
UID:blogto-235916@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/02/original_image2cde0337-07e5-4d19-b5ad-8c26a3c7e2
 87.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Monaco Grand Prix\, Formula 1’s crown jewel. The tight s
 treets of Monte Carlo\, the yachts in the harbour\, the casino lights\, an
 d zero room for mistakes make this the most glamorous and unforgiving week
 end on the calendar.\nJoin us for the ultimate Monaco Grand Prix Watch Par
 ty as F1’s best drivers dance millimetres from the barriers through one 
 of the most iconic circuits in motorsport. Expect strategy chaos\, champag
 ne energy\, and a race where legends are made.\nFast cars. Big drama. Mona
 co magic. Don’t watch it alone.\nFirst 50 tickets are $2 ex-tax with pro
 mo code F1INTOMONACO (max 3 per person). After that\, $6 ex-tax. $8 at the
  door if anything is left.\nReserve early.\nWhat to expect on race day:\nB
 ig screen race broadcast with full-room audio\nPrize drops and giveaways a
 t the chequered flag\nSeated and standing areas\nRace-day atmosphere from 
 lights out to the last lap\nThe run-down:\nDoors open at 8:00 AM ET. Light
 s out is 9:00 AM ET. Come\, hang out and get pumped up for the race.\nThis
  is a reservation event. Book your seat in advance and check in at the doo
 r. Groups of up to 10 can be booked in a single reservation. Seating is al
 located on a first-come\, first-seated basis after check-in.\nThis room wi
 ll sell. Book early.\nDate: Sunday\, June 7th\, 2026 Venue: The Loose Moos
 e\, 146 Front St W\, Toronto\, ON Doors: 8:00 AM ET Lights out: 9:00 AM ET
 \nF1inTO is an independent\, fan-led event. Not affiliated with Formula 1\
 , the FIA\, or any Formula 1 team or rights holder.
LOCATION:The Loose Moose
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/f1into-monaco-grand-prix-watch-party-tor
 ontos-biggest-f1-party-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
