DESCRIPTION:Back by popular demand\, our classic ROM mystery scavenger hun
 t returns!\nThere has been a mysterious murder\, and the museum's collecti
 ons hold the key.  As you gather clues\, you’ll begin to piece together 
 a tale of greed\, lust\, pride\, and revenge. Working in teams\, sleuths t
 ravel through the museum's galleries solving whodunnit\, where\, and with 
 what. Will your team solve the mystery before the clock runs out?\nTickets
  are $47.50 +hst per person and include admission to the Royal Ontario Mus
 eum. Tickets must be purchased in advance. Click the link to learn more ab
 out tickets\, how to prepare\, directions\, FAQs\, and more!\nIf you have 
 a ROM Membership\, please call us for a discount code.\nNote:  We encourag
 e all players (or as many as possible) to bring a fully charged phone with
  our scavenger hunt app downloaded.  Instructions are found on the booking
  page. Your on-site hosts will provide you with your game code and further
  sign-in instructions upon arrival.\nThis hunt is a product of Urban Caper
 s Scavenger Hunts\, and any questions relating to the product\, location\,
  etc. should be directed to Urban Capers at info@urbancapers.com. We’re 
 happy to help!
