 4e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Explore the enduring Indigenous presence in the Bathurst and S
 t. Clair area through its parks\, public art\, and community spaces. Visit
  murals in the area depicting wolves\, guardians\, and layered landscapes\
 , while learning about the Medicine Wheel\, the Dish With One Spoon\, Oran
 ge Shirt Day\, and Indigenous-led care. Along the way\, you’ll hear insp
 iring stories of Indigenous resistance\, healing\, and community-building 
 that continue to shape Toronto.
