 chett-Dunphy-Tucker family tree. Whether you have watched the series from 
 beginning to end multiple times or still quote your favourite scenes daily
 \, this is your chance to prove your Modern Family knowledge.\nGather your
  team\, enjoy great food and drinks\, and prepare for a laugh filled eveni
 ng of friendly competition.\nTRIVIA DETAILS\n🕕 Doors open at 6:00 PM. A
 rrive early\, grab a themed drink\, and get settled in.\n❓ First questio
 n at 7:00 PM sharp. Don’t be late.\n🧠 Three rounds of trivia\, about 
 15 questions each.\n🏆 The top three teams win a Hem’s gift card value
 d between $50 and $100.
LOCATION:Hemingway's
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/modern-family-trivia-toronto-3/
