 ington St W) – Lawn by the bronze cows.\n12:00 PM | St. James Park Garde
 n (120 King St E) – Benches by the central fountain.\n1:10 PM | Goldstru
 ck Coffee Courtyard (130 Cumberland St) – Yorkville Park benches.\nBuy G
 oldstruck's famous Halva Latte (or any beverage of your choosing!) and mee
 t MernaLyn for a fun and exciting event!
