 1e.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Try the matchmaking event that's been dubbed "Yoga for your Lo
 ve Life" by singles\nIn this new world of online dating\, shallow conversa
 tions and superficial standards have become the norm...\nRobbing us of the
  magic that comes with connecting on a deeply meaningful level.\nThat's wh
 y\, here at Tantra Speed Date®\, we do speed dating a little differently.
