BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Art of Stoneground Watercolour: Meet\, Test & Connect
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260610T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260610T150000
UID:blogto-235938@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/02/original_image51abc10e-9971-49d8-aee5-83b651cc1a
 1c.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Free drop-in demo\nDiscover one of our most popular Canadian\,
  hand-made paints: The Stoneground Paint Co.\nMeet founders Jenny and Eric
  for a drop-in session with their collection of watercolour and gouache at
  this open table event. Whether you are a beginner or professional artist\
 , this is a great opportunity to learn about paint-making\, watercolour pa
 int\, and pigments in a relaxed setting. Bring your questions\, your creat
 ivity and let's have a chat!\nAbout\nThe Stoneground Paint Co. is a family
 -owned and operated business located in Regina\, Saskatchewan. Their signa
 ture product is a handmade\, artist-quality watercolour paint inspired by 
 nature and ground by hand. Stoneground crafts their paint in small batches
  the traditional way\, assuring the quality and vivid reflective nature of
  handmade watercolour.\nStoneground puts exceptional care and craftsmanshi
 p into each batch of hand ground paint. Colours are permanent and light fa
 st\, and have a smooth\, fluid consistency.\nPopular Products to Discover\
 nStoneground half-pans palettes\nStoneground half-pans open stock\nOvervie
 w:\n✴︎ Access to in depth product knowledge\n✴︎ Drop-in session\n
 ✴︎ Get to know Stoneground and it's unique properties
LOCATION:Gwartzman's Art Supplies
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-art-of-stoneground-watercolour-meet-
 test-connect-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
