 32.jpg
DESCRIPTION:The Sickest Roast\, a new live comedy show where comedians roa
 st society’s most notorious afflictions\, will debut on June 10\, 2026 a
 t Comedy Bar Danforth taking on the big C - cancer. Proceeds from the even
 t will benefit the Sunnybrook Foundation in support of the Odette Cancer C
 entre in North York.\nHosted by Leslie Seiler\, The Sickest Roast will fea
 ture Guest of Honour and cancer survivor Daniel Stolfi with a talented sla
 te of Roasters including Martha Chaves\, Ken Hall\, Laura Cilevitz\, Fredd
 ie Rivas\, and Kris Siddiqi. With head writer and director Natalie Metcalf
 e\, the tone is bold but thoughtful - punching up\, not down. The result: 
 cathartic\, funny\, and deeply human. The Sickest Roast will be a high-ene
 rgy\, roast-style live comedy show with sharp writing\, and a room that kn
 ows the target is never the people living with illness—the condition its
 elf is the joke.
LOCATION:Comedy Bar Danforth
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-sickest-roast-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
