 d8.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Calling all plant lovers! Have you ever wanted to build your o
 wn terrarium? In celebration of Pride Month\, join fellow plant-loving que
 ers to create your own miniature ecosystem—your very own container oasis
 . This hands-on workshop is open to all\, no experience required.\n\nWe kn
 ow Pride can be joyful\, vibrant\, and sometimes a little overwhelming. Th
 is workshop offers a space to slow down\, connect\, and create something g
 rounding—an oasis you can return to for moments of calm and reflection. 
