 gto.com/events/2026/06/01/original_imageca451958-cdd4-46ce-8632-9d5c1d720a
 92.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Every other Thursday\, check out The Castle on Queen for a pos
 h and proper Trivia Night!\nWHAT TO EXPECT\nYour host\nQE owner\, and come
 dian Ari Issac (@summeroftong)brings the sass and laughs!\nGames\n10 trivi
 a categories testing you on pop culture's best and brightest celebs\, tv\,
  movies\, music\, and so much more!\nInteractive games mixed throughout te
 sting your agility and wit for BONUS points!\nSpecials\nTBA\nWHO SHOULD AT
 TEND\nThink trivia isn’t your thing? Perfect – this is exactly for you
 .\nAt Question Everything Trivia\, we flip the script on your average game
  night. Forget boring\, brain-busting questions and awkward silences – t
 his is trivia reimagined. Expect laughs\, sass\, and pop-culture madness t
 hat keeps everyone engaged\, whether you know the answers or not.\nWe’re
  inclusive\, welcoming\, and all about good vibes.\nPRIZES\nA $50 The Cast
 le on Queen card for 1st place winners!\n1 Hour GRETA Unlimited Play Passe
 s!\n* Additional prizes change on a week-to-week basis\, and are dependent
  on weekly sponsors and attendance.\nVENUE & TICKET RULES\nPlease arrive a
 s close to 6:45 as possible to be seated so that the game can start prompt
 ly at 7PM\nOnce tickets are sold out\, please join waitlist to be the firs
 t to know if someone releases their spot last minute.\n$25 Minimum Spend /
  Person. This is just a couple drinks and food so it shouldn't be hard to 
 reach\, and helps the bar continue to provide these nights and epic prizes
 !\nFor groups of 6 people or more\, a 20% gratuity will be automatically a
 dded to your bill on the day.\n***IMPORTANT: RSVPS ARE NOT GUARANTEED SEAT
 ING***\nRSVPing does not reserve you a spot or table! It is just to notify
  us and the restaurant that people are attending.\nThe restaurant has limi
 ted seating capacity\, so to guarentee your group a spot\, arrive early! S
 itting is all first come first serve.\nPlease make sure you get to get the
 re early to get the best possible spot. An RSVP is not a guarantee\, it's 
 dependant on space. We simply use RSVPs to gauge how many people to expect
 \, but of course as it's a free event\, we sometimes have no-shows. We do 
 what we can to accomodate everyone who RSVPs. If you are concerned about m
 aking the trip\, you can reach out directly to double check about seating\
 , and secure a reservation!
LOCATION:The Castle On Queen
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/question-everything-trivia-the-castle-on
 -queen-l-an-unserious-trivia-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
