 s an intimate evening centred around creativity\, atmosphere\, and the bea
 uty of natural materials. Spend the evening designing your own living terr
 arium inside a glass vessel using specialty aquatic plants\, layered textu
 res\, and curated crystal accents.\nAs part of the experience\, Denovia ha
 s created an exclusive beverage menu for the evening\, featuring specially
  crafted non-alcoholic drinks\, each inspired by its own unique story and 
 concept. Enjoy a drink designed to be experienced alongside the workshop a
 s you slow down and create.\nWhether you’re joining solo\, planning a un
 ique night out\, or sharing the experience with someone\, Botanica offers 
 a beginner-friendly experience designed to help you disconnect from the ev
 eryday and leave with your own living creation.\nYour ticket includes:\n
 ✦ Guided terrarium workshop experience\n✦ Medium glass vessel to take 
 home\n✦ 3 specialty tropical plants\n✦ Curated crystal accents\n✦ Pr
 emium substrate and materials\n✦ All materials included\n✦ 1 handcraft
 ed drink\nEvent Details\nLocation: Denovia Café\, 2656 Yonge St\, Toronto
 \nDate: June 12\, 2026\nTime: 7:00 PM\nDuration: Approx. 90–120 minutes\
 nTicket: $149 CAD per person\nCapacity: Limited to 15 seats for an intimat
 e experience\nReserve your spot and create your own tiny world.
LOCATION:Denovia Cafe
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/botanica-terrarium-crystal-workshop-toro
 nto/
