 ul Williamson and Alexander Cappellazzo\, the concert explores over two ce
 nturies of Caribbean classical music heritage through works by Samuel Fels
 ted\, Noel Da Costa\, Joseph Bologne\, Chevalier de Saint-Georges\, Rashaa
 n Rori Allwood\, Ted Runcie\, and Craig Alistair Bloomfield.
