  talking flavour combos you won’t find in the grocery aisle. Your missio
 n: design a take-home treat that’s 100% you.\nWe’ll show you pro choco
 late-making moves\, minus the TV-chef drama\, so your creation not only ta
 stes amazing but looks next-level. Expect good tunes\, chill energy\, a li
 ttle chocolate trivia\, and plenty of time to build\, snack\, and flex you
 r flavour genius.\n✨ WHAT MAKES THIS UNIQUE ✨\nNo fancy molds or rigid
