 e2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Bi-erasure this Pride? Not on our watch!\nCome celebrate the B
  in 2SLGBTQIA+ with a vibie\, inclusive night of live comedy brought to yo
 u by bi and pansexual comics!\nThis is the perfect first stop on your big 
 turn-up Saturday night out OR an amazing way to celebrate Pride and be hom
 e in bed by 10 30 . Either way\, come through with your pals\, paramore\, 
 or polycule\, have a blast\, and leave feeling awesome for supporting quee
 r\, indie comedy.\nFeaturing the hilarious:\nSashka DC (@sashkadc\, she/th
 ey\, Just for Laughs Originals\, Toxic Comedy)\nJames O'Hara (@jamesoharaa
 f\, he/him\, Winnipeg Comedy Festival\, Gender Venn Diagram Comedy)\nIsabe
 l Zaw-Tun (@isabelzawtun\, she/her\, JFL\, Winnipeg Comedy Festival\, Deba
 ters\, Crap Ass Comedy)\nDre Pavez (@dre.pavez\, she/her\, Let's Go Comedy
 )\nTracy Hamilton (@hamil.trace\, she/her\, Debaters\, CBC Laugh Out Loud\
 , Winnipeg Comedy Festival)\nHosted and produced by Anna Sebastien (@annas
 ebastiencomedy\, they/them\, Just for Laughs Toronto\, Tea4Tea All Trans a
 nd Nonbinary Comedy\, Fresh Hot Babes).\nTickets are $20 (we love to pay q
 ueer artists for their labour!) but all welcome regardless of means - DM @
 annsebastiencomedy on Instagram for community / Pay What You Can pricing.\
 nAll welcome\, including allies\, and especially straight boyfriends of bi
  women (we see you!).\nGrab your 3 or 4 lil bisexual beverages and come on
  laugh your butt off while supporting bi visibility this Pride!
LOCATION:Tallboys
