 e4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Forte – Toronto Gay Men’s Chorus presents In Our Nature\, 
 a Pride concert celebrating identity\, connection\, and the beauty of the 
 world around us\, taking place at the historic Winter Garden Theatre.\nHos
 ted by one of Canada’s top drag performers\, Miss Moço\, this program f
 eatures a vibrant mix of contemporary choral works\, iconic songs\, and ti
 meless classics\, all brought to life in Forte’s signature style.\nRecog
 nized as one of Canada’s leading lower voice choirs\, Forte is an auditi
 oned ensemble drawn from Toronto’s diverse 2SLGBTQIA+ community\, delive
 ring a performance that is both powerful and uplifting.\nA perfect additio
 n to Pride Month\, In Our Nature offers a lush and moving evening of music
  in one of the city’s most stunning performance venues.
