 ce.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Experience Little Manila’s food scene\, migration stories\, 
 and the entrepreneurial spirit of Toronto’s Filipino community.\nDiscove
 r how this North York neighbourhood became a vibrant hub for Toronto’s F
 ilipino community. Through restaurants\, bakeries\, remittance shops\, mur
 als\, and gathering places\, this tour traces stories of migration\, careg
 iving\, entrepreneurship\, and belonging. Along the way\, we’ll explore 
 how food connects families across oceans\, how community spaces foster ide
 ntity and resilience\, and how Little Manila continues to evolve while sta
 ying rooted in culture\, care\, and connection.
LOCATION:Mabuhay Garden\, Bathurst-Wilson Parkette
