ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/02/original_imagee975f4f8-8eaa-4105-a7bb-8af7c3e871
 22.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, June 14 at Reid's Distillery\, Luso-Canadian fadista 
 Jennifer Bettencourt aims to transport you to Lisbon with the evocative bl
 ues of Portugal--fado. Born in the heart of Lisbon's historic neighbourhoo
 ds and lovingly brought to Toronto for all audiences to enjoy\, experience
  Portuguese folk music rich with history and timeless emotions. Accompanie
 d by skilled guitarists Hernani Raposo and Valdemar Mejdoubi\, plus a spec
 ial surprise guest\, Jennifer expertly blends the traditional bittersweet 
 essence of "saudade" with the modernity of an artist fervently keeping the
  flame of fado burning. Spend your Sunday on a passionate Iberian journey 
 in a Canadian "tasca"\, regardless of whether or not you understand Portug
 uese\, and let the universal language of song wash you away into a sea of 
 emotions. Tickets are $15 (+tax and fees) in advance and $20 (+tax and fee
 s) at the door.
LOCATION:Reid's Distillery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/jennifer-bettencourt-fado-distilled-toro
 nto/
