BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queen Out Comedy - A Queer & Fem Open Mic!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260614T210000
UID:blogto-235796@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/30/original_image34a3b233-be59-454c-9b6d-558f2a0f47
 c3.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Looking for stage time to try out your silly lil jokes? Want t
 o hang with other fem and / or queer comedians? Just want to cure your Sun
 day scaries with some comedy?\nWELL you are in luck! Join us for Queen Out
  Open Mic Comedy! <33\nThe list goes out at 6:30pm\, with sign up on a fir
 st come\, first serve basis. The show starts promptly at 7 pm\, and will r
 un to approximately 9 pm (depending on the number of sign ups).\nThis mic 
 is open to anyone that identifies as a woman\, fem\, and / or member of th
 e 2SLGBTQIA+ community. Sorry cis het dude comics - this one's not for you
 .\nYou are welcome to perform\, attend as an audience member to support fe
 m and queer comedy\, or both!!\nThe fine print:\n- 5 minute sets\, "warnin
 g light" at 4 minutes\n- Free to attend with no purchase required\, BUT fe
 el free to tip your host\, and please support the amazing venue if you can
 . There are a range of nonalcoholic and alcoholic beverages for purchase a
 s well as food\n- The venue is fully accessible for mobility aid users inc
 luding communal and single stall gender neutral washrooms at-grade\n- All 
 ages welcome but parental / guardian company is recommended for younger pe
 rformers\n- All are welcome to watch / support this event\, including cisg
 ender heterosexual men\, but performance spaces are open only to fem and /
  or queer folx\n- We will do our best to get everyone up who wants to perf
 orm\, but we also need to be out of the venue before our allotted time end
 s and want to keep the show length manageable and pleasant. This means we 
 may have to cap or limit the list and / or reduce set times if we have mor
 e performers than expected. Please arrive as early as possible to maximize
  your chances of getting on.\n- Community guidelines are in place for this
  show and will be discussed at the top. - This includes no "punching down"
 \, no "isms" or phobias\, and no aggressive crowd work. This mic is hosted
  and produced by a queer\, nonbinary comedian who takes this seriously AF\
 , and who is committed to keeping the vibes cute and inclusive. If content
  of a performance isn't aligned with the guidelines\, the set will be ende
 d early.\n- We all want a sexy\, healthy time! You are totally welcome to 
 wear a mask. If you are feeling sick\, please stay home!
LOCATION:Society Clubhouse
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/queen-out-comedy-a-queer-fem-open-mic-to
 ronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
