 9b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:What happened to Toronto’s original waterfront? Trace the sh
 oreline that once ran near today’s Front Street and discover how the lak
 e’s edge was reshaped by colonization\, industrialism\, and city-buildin
 g. From the Dominion Public Building to St. Lawrence Market and Parliament
  Square Park\, uncover the layers of history beneath the streets: Indigeno
 us land\, archaeological artifacts\, buried waters\, and the people who tr
 ansformed Toronto’s relationship with Lake Ontario.
