BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blood on the Clocktower at Twilight Cafe Downtown Yonge & Bloor
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260616T210000
UID:blogto-235722@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/28/original_imageec99c461-f13b-45c6-bbb1-ed3f7dff4a
 ca.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Whether you're a seasoned gamer or new to the world of social 
 deception games\, this event offers something for everyone. Come solo or w
 ith friends and immerse yourself in a game of Blood on the Clocktower. Our
  events are a great way to connect with members of local communities and a
 re perfect for folks arriving in Toronto looking to make new connections.\
 nWhat is Blood on the Clocktower? - Blood on the Clocktower is an advanced
  version of the game Werewolf\, where crucially\, the dead still have an i
 mportant role to play in the game. The game is run by a Storyteller who ha
 s carefully crafted an experience and facilitates the game for up to 20 pl
 ayers. It is part deduction and part deception. Set in the town of Ravensw
 ood Bluff\, players in the game assume different roles\, each with unique 
 abilities to hunt down evil or manipulate the townsfolk.\nThanks to the ge
 nerosity of Twilight Cafe - Yonge & Bloor\, we will have plenty of space f
 or the night to engage in the social deduction of Blood on the Clocktower.
  Twilight Cafe has a menu with food and both alcoholic and nonalcoholic be
 verages that you can order from while we’re having fun deducing and dece
 iving. Tickets for this event are $20 or $13.50 for Changeling Special Eve
 nts Members.\nIf you have not played before or are newer to the game\, the
 re will be a quick tutorial at the top of the event to learn how to play a
 nd ask any questions from the Storyteller.\nWe will be playing a community
 -favourite custom beginner-friendly script Everyone Can Play at this event
 .\nAge recommendation\, 16 years +\nTo learn more\, find Changeling Gaming
  Events Toronto on Eventbrite or click the website link to see this event 
 (see right side on desktop/above on mobile).
LOCATION:Twilight Cafe Yonge & Bloor
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/blood-on-the-clocktower-at-twilight-cafe
 -downtown-yonge-bloor-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
