BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hot To Go! Queer East Social Pride Bingo & Dance Party
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T203000
UID:blogto-235836@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/01/original_image3adb1dfe-9517-4e00-91d1-5bb31894ec
 f3.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Hot To Go! Queer East Social’s epic Pride bingo 
 & dance party! Fun\, friends\, and fierce vibes IRL!\nQUEER EAST SOCIAL x 
 QE TRIVIA PRESENTS: HOT TO GO! PRIDE PIZZERIA\nWHAT TO EXPECT 🍒☀️
 🍦\nA playful Pride celebration filled with drag bingo\, dancing\, disco
  beats\, scoops\, slices\, patio games\, and queer summer chaos at Café Z
 UZU Pizzeria. Inspired by retro diner discos\, hot summer nights\, melting
  ice cream cones\, and carefree queer joy\, ZUZU transforms into the ultim
 ate summer social\, where the party starts with bingo and ends on the danc
 e floor.\nEVENT FLOW ✨\n6:00 PM — Doors Open\n6:30 PM – 8:00 PM — 
 QE Drag Bingo Hosted by Sucka Queen & Guy Anabella\n*3–4 rounds of drag 
 bingo with prizes\, performances\, cocktails\, and playful summer energy.\
 n8:00 PM – 11:00 PM — AFTER PARTY\nThe tables clear\, the disco turns 
 up\, and the party keeps going.\nON THE BEATS:\nDJ ThirdEye\nDj Kamal\nON 
 THE MENU 🍕🍦\nScoops & Slices featuring:\n• Pizza by the slice\n•
  Pride-themed scoops\n• Boozy milkshakes\n• Summer cocktails\nTHE VIBE
 \n• Retro / 90’s-inspired summer party\n• Diner disco energy\n• Ch
 eeky photo moments\n• Patio games & dancing\n• A playful\, welcoming q
 ueer celebration\nOUR STAND 🌈\nAt Café ZUZU Pizzeria\, we’ve always 
 stood up for our values of equity\, accessibility\, and community. Rooted 
 in Regent Park\, we’re proud to continue creating joyful spaces that cel
