BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trying to Conceive After 35 - Complimentary Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T184500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T200000
UID:blogto-235646@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/27/original_image53ba4f04-e352-40c8-a71b-0806df682a
 10.jpg
DESCRIPTION:A complimentary evening event for women trying to conceive aft
 er 35.\nNaturopathic Doctor Aida Martinez will be hosting an evening centr
 ed around thoughtful conversation\, fertility education\, hormone health\,
  nervous system support\, and the realities of navigating fertility in a w
 ay that feels grounded rather than overwhelming.\nWednesday\, June 17\n6:4
 5 PM – 8:00 PM\nIn person at kāer\nComplimentary evening workshop\nThe 
 evening will include warm tea\, nourishing refreshments\, and space to ask
  questions in a calm and supportive environment.\nWhat You’ll Walk Away 
 With\nA calmer\, more grounded understanding of fertility support after 35
 .\nGreater clarity around what actually matters — and what may be adding
  unnecessary overwhelm.\nPractical ways to support hormone health\, nervou
 s system regulation\, sleep\, nourishment\, and overall wellbeing.\nSpace 
 to ask questions in a supportive\, non-judgmental environment.\nReassuranc
 e that fertility support does not need to feel fear-based or all-consuming
 .\nMost importantly\, our hope is that women leave feeling a little less a
 lone in the process.
LOCATION:kaer wellness
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/trying-to-conceive-after-35-complimentar
 y-event-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
