 03.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join The Bentway and TRCA for this hands-on workshop to learn 
 about the urban wildlife in and around Canoe Landing Park and CityPlace!\n
 How well do you know the urban wildlife in and around Canoe Landing Park a
 nd CityPlace? Learn about the unique flora and fauna adapting in and trave
 rsing our public spaces through an interactive walking tour and hands-on a
 ctivities.\nGain a greater understanding of urban ecology and how to ident
 ify species in the local environment. Towards the end of the session\, par
 ticipants will have the opportunity to plant native wildflower seeds in pa
 per pots to take home to contribute to their own garden or outdoor space!
