BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pool Party with Juicy Love Dion & Athena Dion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T235900
UID:blogto-235850@blogto.com
DESCRIPTION:THIS IS MYKONOS! Everyone’s favourite vibrant\, sun-soaked ?
 ? celebration of love\, inclusivity\, and community is back! With an inter
 national twist\, we return to Cabana Toronto for this Mykonos ?? themed Po
 ol Party!\nHeadlining Pride Toronto’s iconic Pride Pool Party for 2026 i
 s RuPaul’s Drag Race S18 stars ??\, the queens of Mykonos & Miami ??: Ju
 icy Love Dion & Athena. This hot event features electrifying music\, refre
 shing drinks to quench or fuel all your thirsty desires\, and a lively atm
 osphere where everyone can let loose and embrace their true selves.\nIt’
 s the perfect cocktail of fun\, celebration and pride\, making it a must-a
 ttend highlight of Pride Month. Plus this is Pride Toronto’s biggest fun
 draiser\, allowing us to keep the rest of our programming completely free.
  So slink into your sexiest Aegean swimwear\, throw on a Grecian God(dess)
  inspired flowy cover and grab a ticket or a full VIP Cabana to the hottes
 t event of summer!\nPlus the hottest talent in Toronto will be joining her
 . Period. DJs Sophie Jones (FRUITIE\, Frigays) and THIRDEYE (Shorty DJ Hot
 line\, Haus Party) are legends of Toronto going B2B bringing that 365 part
 y girl\, lush life\, gnarly energy. BOOTS. Ms.Myles is your bubbly host\, 
 keeping you thirsty and ready all night long.\nYou loved the cast last yea
 r so much we’re bringing them back! Sanjina DaBish Queen\, the Trans Fij
 ian Bollyhood Remix from Canada’s Drag Race Season 5 is ready to shake t
 hat\, while her drag son Rico Rico brings those sexy summer latin vibes! P
 lus DESTINY\, the resident queen of the pool party is back\, back\, back a
