BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Days:  Group Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T170000
UID:blogto-234775@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/07/original_imaged82cd75d-f2b8-4c09-b684-5dee9e0071
 48.jpg
DESCRIPTION:June 18 - July 8\, 2026\nAs the days stretch longer and the wo
 rld opens up\, the Summer Days group exhibition captures the distinct ener
 gy\, warmth\, and reflection of the summer season. This group exhibition b
 rings together over 25 of Muse gallery’s artists working across painting
 \, sculpture\, and mixed media to explore transformation\, vitality\, grow
 th\, the ephemeral nature of light along with themes of rest and rejuvenat
 ion. While each artist possesses a distinct visual voice\, his or her work
  converges here to offer a multi-faceted look at summer. Through their uni
 que use of various media the artists invite viewers to reflect on their re
 lationship to the nature and the passage of time.\nUltimately\, this group
  summer show serves as both a visual celebration and a conceptual space fo
 r dialogue. We invite you to wander through the space\, engage with the di
 verse narratives presented\, and experience the season through the distinc
 t lenses of these talented creators.
LOCATION:Muse Gallery
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/summer-days-group-show-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Oasis Aqualounge Cup: Pizza Party and Casual Soccer Game
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260618T170000
UID:blogto-235572@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/26/original_image429c4f7d-d8df-40bc-8c47-c957318b73
 6a.jpg
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday June 18\, from 2 pm -5pm\,  participate in the OAC
 : The Oasis Aqualounge Cup.\n\nThis is a great way to get to know some of 
 our club members in a low-key environment and participate in a clothing-op
 tional soccer game. Winners of the soccer game will receive Oasis swag and
  prizes. Complimentary pizza and water will be available.\n\nTransportatio
 n:\nIn the past\, Oasis Aqualounge has offered complimentary transportatio
 n to Cherry Beach\, from the club and back to Oasis\, once the event is ov
 er.  For this event\, we are changing our format slightly to make transpor
 tation more organized and efficient.\n1. Only guests who pay admission to 
 Oasis Aqualounge for the day will receive transportation to and from Cherr
 y Beach.  Guests can pay in advance online via the main event poster\, or 
 pay directly at the club when the venue opens at 1 pm.  https://tickets.oa
 sisaqualounge.com/events/90561\nRides will be arranged between 1pm-1:30pm.
  Anyone who pays admission after 1:30 pm will not have access to transport
 ation.\n2. Guests who pay admission and meet at Oasis Aqualounge will rece
 ive wristbands to indicate that they are part of the transportation group.
 \n3. At 5 pm\, guests who have paid admission and who possess a wristband 
 can receive transportation back to the club. Any guests without a wristban
 d will not receive transportation back to Oasis Aqualounge.\n4. Riders mus
 t meet at the main parking lot on Cherry Street (look for a food truck and
  washrooms) at 5:15 pm sharp. Rides will be arranged between 5:15 pm and 5
 :30 pm. Latecomers will not receive transportation back to the club (regar
 dless of a wristband).  We thank you in advance for your adherence to punc
 tuality\, so that rides can be smooth and organized.\nWe will be meeting e
 veryone at the east end of Cherry Beach at 2 pm.  Upon arrival\, look for 
 the picnic spot and a large\, unicorn floaty.\nPictures may be taken\, but
  you do not have to participate in photos\; stay out of the way of the cam
 eras if that is a concern. While we can't 100% promise that your image won
 't be taken by others (public space) we've had great groups out for our pr
 evious two beach days with a very supportive environment.\nAs this is a pu
 blic space\, open alcohol is not permitted. Please keep this in mind if yo
 u decide to join us.\n\nTo purchase admission to the physical club\, click
  on the main event poster.  There is no additional fee to attend our publi
 c beach party. https://tickets.oasisaqualounge.com/events/90561\n\nOnce th
 e event ends at 5 pm\, feel free to head over to Oasis Aqualounge for more
  clothing-optional\, water-themed fun in the sun.
LOCATION:Cherry Beach
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/the-oasis-aqualounge-cup-pizza-party-and
 -casual-soccer-game-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
