 16.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Lights off\, creativity on at Artbox’s Family Glow-in-the-Da
 rk Paint Session—a fun\, hands-on art experience designed for kids and a
 dults.\nUnder the blacklights in our glow room\, families will paint pour 
 on fluid bears\, bear keychains and canvases using glow in the dark\, neon
  and acrylic paints that come to life in bold\, brilliant colour. Each ses
 sion is designed to spark imagination\, creativity\, and shared moments of
  fun.\nWhat’s Included:\n• Guided instruction and creative encourageme
 nt from our instructor\n• Paint pouring on fluid bear keychains and mini
