 supplies provided\nWho Can Attend:\nOpen to ages 4+. Children must be acco
 mpanied by at least one paying 18+ adult. Families are encouraged to regis
 ter together.\nPlease note: This session takes place in a gallery space\, 
 and touching displayed artwork is not permitted.\nJoin us for a glowing fa
 mily art experience at Artbox—reserve your spot today!\nNo experience ne
 eded!\nSee more events at: https://www.artboxstudiogallery.com/calendar\nC
 all us at: 647-617-9550
