DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T210000
UID:blogto-235877@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/01/original_image5d9d433f-5b5c-4cbe-939e-af8127f245
 b9.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join 38 for an evening of creativity\, connection\, and commun
 ity at the 38 Fundraiser.\n38 is a Toronto-based creative community that b
 rings people together through art\, storytelling\, and cultural experience
 s. This fundraiser will support our ongoing efforts to create opportunitie
 s for Black artists and creatives in Toronto while fostering spaces where 
 people can connect\, collaborate\, and build meaningful relationships.\nGu
 ests will enjoy an evening of conversation\, networking\, light refreshmen
 ts\, and community in a welcoming creative environment. Whether you're an 
