 of Canada\, Capitalism\, and Colonialism!\nThis monumental work offers rea
 ders access to a clear-eyed understanding of Canada’s past\, explaining 
 how recently-acknowledged dark facts about our history are tied to the cre
 ation of a richly endowed\, wealthy but very unequal first world country.\
