BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:UNTITLED
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260620T220000
UID:blogto-235537@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/25/original_imagefe526816-bd45-45db-a6db-aa62b6e509
 ca.jpg
DESCRIPTION:This is not an exhibition you simply walk through\; it is a wo
 rld you inhabit.\nExperience the grounding work of multidisciplinary artis
 t Simone Patrica in a multi-sensory landscape of Art\, Film\, and Culinary
  Narrative. Anchored by the vision of Chef FT (Lamuren).\nYour entry into 
 the immersive grants you full inhabitancy of the space and includes:\nSpat
 ial Exploration: Full access to the multidisciplinary installations of Sim
 one Patricia.\nThe Dialogue: A private screening of an interview-style fil
 m\, capturing the artist's voice and the philosophy behind the work.\nA Se
 quenced Culinary Narrative: A three-course sensory interpretation by Chef 
 FT (Lamuren) served at our communal table:\nThe Prelude: An individual app
 etizer to ground the palate.\nThe Communion: A shared main course designed
  to foster connection.\nThe Epilogue: A curated dessert to conclude the st
 ory.\nWine Pairing: A curated selection designed to complement each course
 \, with your choice of Alcoholic or Non-Alcoholic options.\nOriginal Artwo
 rk: A physical work created by Simone Patricia\, curated specifically for 
 you to take home and anchor the narrative within your own space.
LOCATION:Care/Of Experiences
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/untitled-toronto/
