 ething to celebrate and more like a day to get through. Fatherless Day off
 ers something different.\nHosted by The Parentless Club\, it’s a hang fo
 r people missing their dads to spend the day alongside others who just get
  it. There’ll be beer\, sandwiches\, tattoos\, and the kind of conversat
