 Think About Me featuring Madeleine Roger\nAugust 20: Persian Psychedelia f
 eaturing Neda Mohamadpour\nAugust 23: Journey to the Middle East featuring
  Al Qahwa\nAugust 27: BEING: PASCALKAIJA featuring The Happenstancers
