UID:blogto-235131@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/16/original_image3a41a11c-ffd9-46d4-bdba-c840438935
 7b.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun evening of speed dating. Who knows\, you mig
 ht just meet that special someone!\nCalling Toronto singles in the west en
 d!\nJoin us for a fun and social evening of speed dating! You'll meet up t
 o 15 other singles on short dates to see if there is a match.\n**IMPORTANT
 : We are using our new web application\, so please make sure you set up a 
 profile at www.15firstdates.ca before the event.\nHow speed dating works i
 s that you will meet members of the opposite sex for quick dates\, and the
 n you will give them a Like or a Pass on your phone. They will then do the
  same thing for you. If there is a mutual match\, you will be able to mess
 age each other the next day!\nWe will give you all needed materials\, and 
 explain the process to you once everyone has arrived. You don't need to br
 ing anything\, just come dressed for success and your phone fully charged 
 and logged in to your 15FirstDates.ca account.\nThis event is for people a
 ged 35-45. This age group usually sells out fast\, so get your tickets now
  while you can!
