UID:blogto-235937@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/06/02/original_imagef9164789-1f92-461d-97af-af8db6bf65
 ed.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Take the mystery out of oil painting!\nWinsor & Newton Artists
 ’ Oil Colour Demonstration\nOil colour has been around for 600 years but
  it can still be daunting.\nLuckily Winsor & Newton has been at it for lon
 g time too! If you’ve wanted\nto dive into oil painting but don’t know
  where to start\, this demonstration\nwith Olivia Di Gregorio will help ta
 ke the mystery out of the materials and\nthe painting process.\nAll 133 of
  the Artists’ Oil Colours have the highest level of pigmentation\nconsis
 tent with the broadest handling properties which gives artists\nexcellent 
 covering power and tinting strength. Artists in attendance will\nlearn rul
 es such as fat over lean that will help them create paintings of long-\nla
 sting permanence as well as fundamentals of colour mixing\, pigment\nchara
 cteristics and introduction to Winsor & Newton Liquin alkyd mediums.\nJoin
  Olivia and show up with your oil painting questions so she can help\nyou 
 on your oil painting journey.\nWho is this for?\nArtists\, hobbyists and b
 eginners interested in exploring oil painting\, or getting a little techni
 cal refresher.\nAbout your instructor\nOlivia Di Gregorio is an internatio
 nally exhibited and published artist in Toronto\, having graduated from OC
 AD University in 2019 with a Bachelor of Design in Illustration\, and a mi
 nor in Drawing & Painting. Since graduating\, Di Gregorio was chosen as a 
 finalist in the Traditional Art category for the Beautiful Bizarre Magazin
 e Art Prize in 2021\, and has\nexhibited work in international galleries f
 rom San Francisco\, Denver\, South Korea\, and the UK. Her paintings have 
 also been published in Supersonic Art\, and BOOOOOOOM’s ‘Tomorrow’s 
 Talent’ Vol. II\, and Vol. III.\nOverview\n〰️ Learn oil painting rul
 es\n〰️ Dive into mediums\n〰️ Try out some artist materials\n〰️
  Come prepared with questions!
LOCATION:Gwartzman's Art Supplies
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/winsor-newton-oil-colours-with-olivia-di
 -gregorio-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
