 a2.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Mike Cannon Live in Toronto\n4 Shows Only\, June 26 & 27\nBack
 room Comedy Club | Toronto\nOne of the fastest-rising comics in New York i
 s coming to Toronto for 4 intimate shows only.\nMike Cannon has quietly be
 come one of the most dangerous stand-ups working today\; known for his raz
 or-sharp crowd work\, brutally honest storytelling\, and the kind of unfil
 tered comedy that feels like old-school comedy clubs before everything bec
 ame safe and corporate.\nYou’ve seen him on:\nMatt and Shane’s Secret 
 Podcast\nChrissy Chaos\nBarstool Sports\nComedy Central\nKill Tony univers
 e appearances\nand across millions of views online\nNow he’s bringing th
 at raw NYC comedy-club energy to Backroom Comedy Club — Toronto’s unde
 rground dojo of funny.\nThis is not a theatre show.\nThis is stand-up the 
 way it’s supposed to be:\nlow ceilings\, real comics\, no bad seats\, an
 d absolutely nowhere to hide.\nIf you’re a fan of podcast comedy\, New Y
 ork club comics\, or uncensored late-night stand-up\, this is the show you
  don’t want to hear about afterward.\nAnd with only 55 seats per show\, 
 these will sell out quickly.\nSHOW DATES\nFriday\, June 26\n8:00 PM\n10:00
  PM\nSaturday\, June 27\n8:00 PM\n10:00 PM\nTICKETS\nGeneral Admission —
  $35\nLimited seating available.\nVENUE\nBackroom Comedy Club\n814 Bloor S
 t W\nToronto\, Ontario\n18+\nABOUT BACKROOM COMEDY CLUB\nBackroom Comedy C
 lub is Toronto’s underground comedy dojo — a raw\, intimate room built
  for comics and audiences who still want comedy to feel dangerous\, honest
 \, and alive.\nNo velvet ropes. No bullshit. Just killers\, chaos\, and th
 e truth.\nFollow us on Instagram for clips\, lineup updates\, and future s
 hows.
