 nues\, one question at the centre: how do we actually connect in the world
  we're living in now?\nTaking place June 27–28\, anchored at the Centre 
 for Social Innovation and extending across the city\, the weekend brings t
 ogether speakers\, facilitators\, and artists for talks\, workshops\, and 
 guided experiences. Programming spans dating\, relationships\, communicati
 on\, and personal growth\, alongside experiential practices involving move
 ment\, breath\, and relaxation.\nAnthropos is designed for adults interest
 ed in improving their relationships\, communication\, and overall well-bei
