 rmances\, dancers and costumes galore\, huge crowds\, and a never ending s
 tream of the finest Drag Kings\, Things and Queens! Get there early to sec
 ure a good spot\, as this is\, by far\, the most popular event of Pride Mo
 nth\, or get a VIP pass for a guaranteed front-of-stage up-close view. Mee
