 ae.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, June 27  // Doors 10PM\nTickets $15 – $60 + fees\
 nDon't think. Just bite. Details coming soon.\nAbout New Ho Queen\nNew Ho 
 Queen is a nightlife collective of Trans and Queer Asian artists working a
 cross music\, performance\, design\, fashion\, and film. Since 2018\, they
 ’ve been creating vibrant\, safer party spaces for people to connect\, c
 elebrate\, and center Queer Asian joy.\nRooted in community\, their work m
 oves between nightlife and cultural programming. They’ve hosted thousand
 s of attendees and commissioned hundreds of QTBIPOC artists\, building a s
 pace where Asian artists are seen at their best.\nNew Ho Queen is currentl
 y a Party-in-Residence at Buddies in Bad Times Theatre (2024 – 2026)\, a
 nd has been featured in W Magazine.
