 7d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a tail-wagging weekend at the annual Party 4 Paw
 s Pet Fair at Trinity Bellwoods Park in downtown Toronto!\n🐾 Calling Al
 l Animal Lovers & Pet Parents! 🐾\nJoin us at the Party 4 Paws Pet Fair 
 in Toronto for a heartwarming\, tail-wagging celebration of everything we 
 love about our furry companions.\nHosted at Trinity Bellwoods Park\, this 
 outdoor pet fair brings together passionate animal lovers\, devoted pet ow
 ners\, and dedicated animal rescue groups for a weekend full of connection
  and community.\nThis two-day outdoor pet festival features:\n• Toronto 
 pet vendors\n• Dog treats\, toys & accessories\n• Local and internatio
 nal animal rescues\n• Adoption information\n• Family-friendly activiti
 es\n• Dog-friendly outdoor shopping\nWhether you’re a proud pet parent
 \, thinking about adopting\, or simply can’t resist stopping to pet ever
 y dog you pass\, Party 4 Paws is your kind of crowd.\nBring your leash\, b
 ring your love for animals\, and join us for a paws-itively unforgettable 
 weekend!\nFollow us on social media @guardiansbest\nVisit us at www.guardi
 ansbest.com
