ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/28/original_image1596c1bd-9ae0-47cb-8ff5-f76b72bafb
 89.jpg
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, June 27\, 2026\, we are taking over Woodington L
 ake Golf Club for our flagship Summer Signature event\, bringing together 
 144 players for a high-energy day. The afternoon is centred  around a uniq
 ue social format where four-man scramble teams are paired into interactive
