 rt collector or just looking for a unique weekend plan\, this all-ages eve
 nt is packing a lot into a single afternoon.\nShop Local\, Get Creative\nT
 he market will feature over 30+ local vendors and artists from across Etob
 icoke\, showcasing everything from unique exotic crafts to handmade jewelr
 y. But it’s not just about browsing\; it’s about doing.\nThe event is 
