 2f.jpg
DESCRIPTION:After 20 years apart\, a circle of artists reunite for one ext
 raordinary evening of flamenco. Rosas y Claveles (Roses and Carnations) is
  a celebration of artistry and enduring friendship.\nRooted in tradition\,
  this special performance honours beauty\, longevity and the magic that ha
 ppens when kindred spirits come together again. Like roses and carnations\
 , they have\nflourished through time but always shine brightest together.\
 nBaile: Nancy Cardwell\, Angela Déiseach\, Maureen Déiseach\, Catalina F
 ellay & Christine Taranco\nCante: Shirley ‘La Pili’ Pincay\nToque: Nic
 olas Hernandez\nSpecial Thank You to Esmeralda Enrique for bringing us tog
 ether all those years ago♡
LOCATION:Rivoli
