BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unwell\, But Funny
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260630T213000
UID:blogto-235467@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/05/24/original_image7fd05ec3-97cc-4eb2-a7c2-b3bc72fa25
 3d.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Tuesdays are officially the new Fridays. The best thing to do 
 on a Tuesday? Laugh at the chaos that is life. Unwell\, But Funny is back 
 after a sold-out debut\, bigger\, messier\, and more unhinged. Toronto’s
  sharpest comics bring dating disasters\, family problems\, anxiety spiral
