BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tantra Speed Date  Toronto Meet Singles Speed Dating
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260708T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260708T220000
UID:blogto-234349@blogto.com
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2026/04/29/original_image65385ff8-d923-4634-97f5-19bd9a1ba7
 e4.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Try the matchmaking event that's been dubbed "Yoga for your Lo
 ve Life" by singles\nIn this new world of online dating\, shallow conversa
 tions and superficial standards have become the norm...\nRobbing us of the
  magic that comes with connecting on a deeply meaningful level.\nThat's wh
 y\, here at Tantra Speed Date®\, we do speed dating a little differently.
 \nYou'll engage with your dates in a way that's fun\, authentic\, and even
  healing.\nWe'll guide you through a sequence of relationship-building exe
 rcises with up to 20 singles.\nEach exercise will aid you and your date in
  playfully exploring the depth of your connection. (Think verbal dyads\, m
 ovement/dancing\, and communication games!)\nAnd all of them enhance your 
 relationship skills in subtle\, yet powerful ways.\nSo you'll walk away no
 t only with matches...\nBut with the tools you need to bring more love int
 o your dating life!\nOver 31\,759 singles have gone on 232\,747 dates in 5
 0+ cities worldwide. 94.09% have matched with one or more dates. If you do
 n't match\, your next event is on us!\nGet your ticket today and experienc
