 tive soul.\nThis dog-friendly walk will guide you past places like Graffit
 i Alley\, celebrated art galleries\, and some of the city’s best vintage
  shops and independent boutiques. You’ll also get a taste of Queen West
 ’s vibes\, with dog-friendly patios and hidden local gems waiting to be 
 discovered.\nBefore or after the walk\, explore our signature Barket Marke
 t at Queen and Denison Street with local vendors and businesses offering u
 nique finds for you and your dog\, plus exciting activations and photo opp
 ortunities you won't want to miss!\nWhether you’re into street art\, one
 -of-a-kind fashion finds\, or just looking to connect with a creative and 
 welcoming community\, this walk offers the perfect mix of culture & style.
