 gto.com/events/2026/05/28/original_imagecf9e973b-3c94-4e23-b2fd-a6dce11349
 72.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Trade your usual night out for an evening of creative experime
 ntation and social connection! Our weekly beginner-friendly Art Socials in
 vite you to try hands-on creative techniques. Whether it’s cheering on y
 our favourite Toronto sports teams this summer\, grabbing a TTC transfer o
 n the first day of a new year\, spotting the elusive white squirrel of Tri
 nity Bellwoods park\, or grabbing a beef patty on your way home from schoo
 l\, this workshop is about commemorating the things that make Toronto a sp
 ecial place to you.\nYou will learn how to create your own image on styrof
 oam blocks and then print a series of 5 “Toronto trading cards”. At th
 e end of the workshop\, you are invited to trade some of your cards with y
 our fellow civic superfans and take home your own collection of uniquely T
 oronto experiences. Come solo or with friends\, and leave with something y
 ou made yourself!
LOCATION:The Bentway Studio
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/art-socials-printmaking-toronto-trading-
 cards-toronto/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
