 om VinBon\nThis event will feature Guest Speaker and owner of VinBon\, Mic
 hael (Mike) Perrella. Vin Bon is Ontario’s largest Boutique Micro Winery
 \, crafting custom\, small-batch wines from fresh imported juice — no wa
 ter added\, minimal preservatives\, and fully vegan. With nearly 40 years 
