 l prices\, backed by a 100% guarantee.\nContact VinBon at (647) 985-0633 o
 r info@vinbon.ca and visit www.vinbon.com to learn more about their produc
 ts and services.\nREGISTER HERE: https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events
 -richmond-hill\n- VENUE: VinBon Richmond Hill\n- ADDRESS: 10620 Yonge St\,
  Richmond Hill\, ON\n- PARKING: Free\, onsite.\nEVENT ITINERARY:\n* 6:00-7
 :00pm: Open networking\n* 7:00-7:02pm: GTApreneurs presentation\n* 7:02-7:
 10pm: Mike Perella presentation: “What are the best wines to go with you
 r favorite foods?”\n* 7:10-8:00pm: Open networking\nTICKETS\n* GTApreneu
 rs Members: Free\n* Non-members: $25 in advance or $27 on event day\nNot a
