 bf.jpg
DESCRIPTION:If your kids like dinosaurs and outdoor play\, they’ll love 
 Dino Runs at The Bentway!\nStep into a prehistoric adventure at the Bentwa
 y’s iconic figure-eight skate trail under the Gardiner Expressway! This 
 fun-filled event invites young explorers to learn\, move\, and play in an 
 outdoor\, interactive setting that brings dinosaurs to life.\nThe morning 
 kicks off with costumed Dino Specialists\, who use songs\, dance\, storyte
 lling\, and hands-on games to teach kids fascinating facts about their fav
 orite dinosaurs. From learning how the T-Rex roared to discovering how Vel
 ociraptors ran\, this engaging session sparks curiosity and imagination. T
 hen\, it’s time for action! The kids will transform into Dino Explorers\
 , tasked with chasing and recapturing runaway dinosaurs in an exciting\, n
 on-competitive run around our 220m figure-eight skate trail.
LOCATION:The Bentway Skate Trail
URL:https://www.blogto.com/events/dino-run-toronto-2/
X-SOURCE:blogTO
END:VEVENT
