ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://blogto-production2-baselayer-display.blo
 gto.com/events/2025/12/29/original_imageed51f478-89ff-4860-9aa4-9a59a0ab2f
 16.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Fleeting moments and beauty of urban life captured through wat
 ercolour\, oils\, and gouache paintings that invite viewers to pause\, con
 nect and slow down to reflect beautifully in memory. Anchored in connectio
 n\, this exhibition by Dinesh Subramanian and Isabel Fryszberg preserves t
 he essence of human interwovenness.\nExhibit is open from September 3\, 20
 26 until October 3\, 2026\nEvery Monday to Friday at 10 a.m. - 5 p.m.\nEve
 ry Saturday at 10 a.m. - 1 p.m.\nOpening reception: September 3\, 6 p.m. -
  8 p.m.\nGallery is closed on Sundays and statutory holidays.
LOCATION:Assembly Hall
